915
00:49:36,601 --> 00:49:38,061
Lilo!

916
00:49:39,104 --> 00:49:40,271
What happened?

917
00:49:40,313 --> 00:49:44,234
Oh... some lolo must have
stuffed us in the barrel.

918
00:49:44,275 --> 00:49:45,694
Where's Stitch?

919
00:49:48,238 --> 00:49:49,239
Get off of her!

920
00:49:50,573 --> 00:49:52,075
What happened?

921
00:49:52,117 --> 00:49:54,411
Stitch dragged her down.

922
00:50:01,960 --> 00:50:03,920
We lost Stitch!

923
00:50:29,571 --> 00:50:32,407
Lilo? Lilo, look at me.

924
00:50:32,449 --> 00:50:34,075
Look at me, baby.
Are you hurt?

925
00:50:34,117 --> 00:50:36,161
No.

926
00:50:40,040 --> 00:50:43,835
He's unconscious,
but I think he's alive.

927
00:50:56,848 --> 00:50:59,559
David, take Lilo.

928
00:50:59,601 --> 00:51:01,644
This isn't what it looks like.

929
00:51:01,686 --> 00:51:02,812
We were...

930
00:51:02,854 --> 00:51:05,357
It-It's just that...

931
00:51:08,526 --> 00:51:10,445
I know you're trying, Nani

932
00:51:10,487 --> 00:51:14,324
but you need to think
about what's best for Lilo...

933
00:51:14,366 --> 00:51:18,161
even if it removes you
from the picture.

934
00:51:21,873 --> 00:51:26,127
I'll be back tomorrow morning
for Lilo.

935
00:51:26,169 --> 00:51:28,129
I'm sorry.

936
00:51:33,218 --> 00:51:38,348
Nani? Is there something
I can do?

937
00:51:38,390 --> 00:51:39,641
No, David.

938
00:51:39,683 --> 00:51:43,895
Uh, I need
to take Lilo home now.

939
00:51:43,937 --> 00:51:47,482
We have a lot to talk about,
Lilo.

940
00:51:47,524 --> 00:51:50,568
Thanks.

941
00:51:53,279 --> 00:51:58,410
You know, I really believed
they had a chance.

942
00:51:58,451 --> 00:52:02,247
Then you came along.

943
00:52:26,855 --> 00:52:29,858
Lilo, honey...

944
00:52:29,899 --> 00:52:33,820
we have to, uh...

945
00:52:35,447 --> 00:52:36,740
Don't worry.

946
00:52:36,781 --> 00:52:39,701
You're nice, and someone
will give you a job.

947
00:52:39,743 --> 00:52:42,412
I would.

948
00:52:45,290 --> 00:52:46,875
Come here.

949
00:52:53,131 --> 00:52:57,927
# Aloha Oe #

950
00:52:57,969 --> 00:53:03,058
# Aloha Oe #

951
00:53:03,099 --> 00:53:12,359
# E ke onaona noho i ka lipo #

952
00:53:12,400 --> 00:53:22,202
# One fond embrace,
a ho'i a'e au #

953
00:53:22,243 --> 00:53:30,418
# Until we meet again. #

954
00:53:49,896 --> 00:53:52,732
That's us before...

955
00:53:52,816 --> 00:53:56,736
It was rainy,
and they went for a drive.

956
00:53:56,820 --> 00:54:01,616
What happened to yours?

957
00:54:01,658 --> 00:54:04,327
I hear you cry at night.

958
00:54:04,369 --> 00:54:06,162
Do you dream about them?

959
00:54:09,290 --> 00:54:11,584
I know that's
why you wreck things

960
00:54:11,626 --> 00:54:13,628
and push me.

961
00:54:18,925 --> 00:54:23,596
Our family's little now
and we don't have many toys

962
00:54:23,638 --> 00:54:27,934
but if you want,
you could be part of it.

963
00:54:27,976 --> 00:54:32,856
You could be our baby
and we'd raise you to be good.

964
00:54:36,526 --> 00:54:38,445
"O'hana" means family.

965
00:54:38,486 --> 00:54:43,491
"Family" means nobody gets
left behind

966
00:54:43,533 --> 00:54:48,079
but if you want to leave,
you can.

967
00:54:53,626 --> 00:54:58,006
I'll remember you, though.

968
00:54:58,048 --> 00:55:01,593
I remember everyone that leaves.

969
00:55:30,413 --> 00:55:32,874
L... L...

970
00:55:32,916 --> 00:55:35,335
Lost.

971
00:55:42,592 --> 00:55:45,637
I'm lost.

972
00:55:50,558 --> 00:55:52,602
Help!

973
00:55:52,644 --> 00:55:54,729
I don't like the ocean!

974
00:55:57,232 --> 00:55:58,733
Oh, look,
a friendly little dolphin.

975
00:55:59,984 --> 00:56:01,611
They helped sailors
in the war...

976
00:56:01,653 --> 00:56:03,446
It's a shark!

977
00:56:03,488 --> 00:56:05,198
It's a shark,
and it ain't friendly!

978
00:56:05,240 --> 00:56:06,366
It looks like a dolphin.

979
00:56:06,408 --> 00:56:07,492
Tricky fish! Tricky fish!

980
00:56:07,534 --> 00:56:08,868
Oh, octopus, come and help me?

981
00:56:08,910 --> 00:56:11,871
An octo... octopus is worse
than a shark!

982
00:56:11,913 --> 00:56:13,540
I hate this planet!

983
00:56:18,920 --> 00:56:20,922
Oh...

984
00:56:20,964 --> 00:56:24,300
little monster!

985
00:56:30,473 --> 00:56:33,101
Uh, Agent Pleakley here.

986
00:56:33,143 --> 00:56:35,562
I have lost patience
with you both.

987
00:56:35,603 --> 00:56:38,940
Have you captured 6-2-6 or not?

988
00:56:38,982 --> 00:56:39,983
Um...

989
00:56:40,025 --> 00:56:41,609
Uh-uh...

990
00:56:41,651 --> 00:56:43,820
Consider yourselves fired
and prisonbound.

991
00:56:43,862 --> 00:56:47,615
Your incompetence is nothing
short of unspeakable!

992
00:56:48,825 --> 00:56:49,951
But, uh... mm...

993
00:56:51,661 --> 00:56:54,164
We're fired!

994
00:56:54,205 --> 00:56:56,666
Now we do it my way!

995
00:56:56,708 --> 00:56:57,834
Your way?

996
00:56:58,960 --> 00:57:00,545
Oh... uh, wait!

997
00:57:00,587 --> 00:57:03,173
It seems I have overestimated
Jumber and Blinkley.

998
00:57:03,214 --> 00:57:05,425
Uh, Jumba and Pleakley.

999
00:57:05,467 --> 00:57:08,219
Whatever. The mission
is in jeopardy.

1000
00:57:08,261 --> 00:57:13,183
This could be your chance to
redeem yourself, Captain Gantu.

1001
00:57:13,224 --> 00:57:16,394
How soon will you be prepared
to leave?

1002
00:57:16,436 --> 00:57:19,397
Immediately.

1003
00:57:33,828 --> 00:57:34,788
Don't run.

1004
00:57:34,829 --> 00:57:36,664
Don't make me shoot you.

1005
00:57:36,706 --> 00:57:39,834
You were expensive.

1006
00:57:39,876 --> 00:57:41,670
Yes. Yes, that's it.

1007
00:57:41,711 --> 00:57:44,339
Come quietly.

1008
00:57:44,381 --> 00:57:46,174
Mm... waiting.

1009
00:57:46,216 --> 00:57:47,175
For what?

1010
00:57:50,095 --> 00:57:52,389
Family.

1011
00:57:52,430 --> 00:57:54,683
Ah!

1012
00:57:54,724 --> 00:57:56,726
You don't have one.

1013
00:57:56,768 --> 00:57:59,354
I made you.

1014
00:57:59,396 --> 00:58:02,732
Oh... maybe I could...

1015
00:58:02,816 --> 00:58:04,818
You're built to destroy.

1016
00:58:04,859 --> 00:58:09,322
You can never belong.

1017
00:58:09,322 --> 00:58:11,950
Now come quietly
and we will take you apart.

1018
00:58:11,991 --> 00:58:13,993
No, no, no, no,
don't, don't run!

1019
00:58:14,035 --> 00:58:15,161
Don't run!

1020
00:58:30,719 --> 00:58:31,845
Lilo.

1021
00:58:32,887 --> 00:58:34,723
I didn't hear you get up.

1022
00:58:37,058 --> 00:58:38,810
Baby, what's wrong?

1023
00:58:38,852 --> 00:58:40,562
Stitch left.

1024
00:58:40,603 --> 00:58:41,896
Really?

1025
00:58:41,938 --> 00:58:44,274
It's good he's gone.

1026
00:58:44,315 --> 00:58:47,694
He didn't want to be here,
anyway.

1027
00:58:47,777 --> 00:58:49,362
We don't need him.

1028
00:58:52,615 --> 00:58:54,701
Lilo...

1029
00:58:54,784 --> 00:58:57,620
sometimes you try your hardest

1030
00:58:57,662 --> 00:59:02,417
but things don't work out
the way you want them to.

1031
00:59:02,459 --> 00:59:05,420
Sometimes things have to change

1032
00:59:05,462 --> 00:59:09,674
and maybe sometimes
they're for the better...

1033
00:59:09,758 --> 00:59:11,217
even if...

1034
00:59:12,761 --> 00:59:15,805
Nani!

1035
00:59:15,847 --> 00:59:17,682
David!

1036
00:59:17,724 --> 00:59:19,225
I think I found you a job.

1037
00:59:19,267 --> 00:59:20,477
You what?!

1038
00:59:20,518 --> 00:59:23,146
Old man Kukhkini's store,
but we got to hurry.

1039
00:59:23,188 --> 00:59:26,024
Oh, um, okay. Lilo?

1040
00:59:26,066 --> 00:59:27,609
Baby, this is really important.

1041
00:59:27,650 --> 00:59:29,694
I need you to stay here
for a few minutes.

1042
00:59:29,778 --> 00:59:31,154
I'm going to be right back.

1043
00:59:31,196 --> 00:59:34,449
Lock the door and don't
answer it for anyone, okay?

1044
00:59:35,867 --> 00:59:39,162
Things are finally
turning around.

1045
00:59:39,204 --> 00:59:41,331
Aw, David, I owe you one.

1046
00:59:41,373 --> 00:59:42,916
That's okay.

1047
00:59:42,957 --> 00:59:45,543
You can just date me,
and we'll call it even.

1048
00:59:51,591 --> 00:59:53,718
Come back here, you little...!

1049
00:59:57,097 --> 00:59:58,723
Stitch?

1050
00:59:58,765 --> 00:59:59,891
What is it?

1051
00:59:59,933 --> 01:00:01,226
Shh!

1052
01:00:02,727 --> 01:00:04,979
Oh, hiding
behind your little friend

1053
01:00:05,021 --> 01:00:06,314
won't work anymore.

1054
01:00:06,356 --> 01:00:07,565
Didn't I tell you?

1055
01:00:07,607 --> 01:00:09,401
We got fired this morning.

1056
01:00:10,694 --> 01:00:12,821
New rules.

1057
01:00:12,862 --> 01:00:14,656
Ha!

1058
01:00:14,698 --> 01:00:15,657
Ooh.

1059
01:00:16,908 --> 01:00:18,535
Oh, ooh! Ow! Ow! Ow!

1060
01:00:20,078 --> 01:00:22,163
# You ain't nothin'
but a hound dog... #

1061
01:00:22,205 --> 01:00:23,456
What are we going to do?

1062
01:00:23,498 --> 01:00:24,874
# ...Cryin' all the time... #

1063
01:00:24,916 --> 01:00:26,084
Ooh! I love this song!

1064
01:00:26,126 --> 01:00:27,127
Pliers.

1065
01:00:28,169 --> 01:00:29,129
Screwdriver.

1066
01:00:29,170 --> 01:00:30,213
Check.

1067
01:00:30,255 --> 01:00:31,214
Come out, my friend

1068
01:00:31,256 --> 01:00:32,674
from whomever
you're hiding behind.

1069
01:00:32,799 --> 01:00:34,676
# ...Well, you ain't never
caught a rabbit #

1070
01:00:34,801 --> 01:00:36,469
# And you ain't no friend
of mine... #

1071
01:00:36,511 --> 01:00:37,804
What the...?

1072
01:00:37,846 --> 01:00:40,015
Ooh!

1073
01:00:41,808 --> 01:00:42,809
Come on!

1074
01:00:42,809 --> 01:00:43,893
What's the big deal?

1075
01:00:45,353 --> 01:00:47,814
I'll put you
back together again.

1076
01:00:47,814 --> 01:00:50,608
I'll make you taller
and not so fluffy!

1077
01:00:50,650 --> 01:00:52,610
I like fluffy!

1078
01:00:52,652 --> 01:00:54,237
No... No...

1079
01:00:54,279 --> 01:00:55,905
No!

1080
01:00:57,657 --> 01:01:00,618
Oh, leave my mother
out of this!

1081
01:01:02,037 --> 01:01:04,122
You could do with a makeover.

1082
01:01:04,164 --> 01:01:06,541
I tried
to give you my good looks

1083
01:01:06,583 --> 01:01:09,461
but let's face it,
something went wrong.

1084
01:01:09,502 --> 01:01:10,628
No!

1085
01:01:14,632 --> 01:01:15,675
Quick! Follow me!

1086
01:01:15,717 --> 01:01:16,718
If we make it to...

1087
01:01:16,843 --> 01:01:17,719
You're alive!

1088
01:01:17,844 --> 01:01:18,970
They're all over the place!

1089
01:01:20,305 --> 01:01:22,265
Running away? Here...

1090
01:01:22,307 --> 01:01:23,808
let me stop you.

1091
01:01:26,019 --> 01:01:28,146
You always get
in the way!

1092
01:01:28,188 --> 01:01:29,189
Where's the girl?

1093
01:01:29,189 --> 01:01:30,607
What have you done
to the girl?

1094
01:01:30,648 --> 01:01:31,858
Hello? Cobra Bubbles?

1095
01:01:31,900 --> 01:01:34,277
Aliens are attacking my house.

1096
01:01:34,319 --> 01:01:37,030
No, no, no!
No aliens!

1097
01:01:39,532 --> 01:01:41,659
Blue punch buggy!

1098
01:01:43,203 --> 01:01:44,496
No punch back.

1099
01:01:45,538 --> 01:01:46,664
They want my dog!

1100
01:01:46,706 --> 01:01:48,458
There's no need
to alert the authorities.

1101
01:01:48,500 --> 01:01:49,668
Everything's under control.

1102
01:01:49,709 --> 01:01:51,670
Lilo, who was that?

1103
01:01:51,711 --> 01:01:53,755
Oh, good,
my dog found the chainsaw.

1104
01:01:53,797 --> 01:01:54,964
Lilo! Don't hang...!

1105
01:02:02,764 --> 01:02:04,432
Ha!

1106
01:02:04,474 --> 01:02:05,558
You shouldn't play with guns.

1107
01:02:05,600 --> 01:02:06,559
Oh, okay.

1108
01:02:06,601 --> 01:02:07,560
Thank you.

1109
01:02:09,062 --> 01:02:10,855
Oh, I just remembered.
It's your birthday!

1110
01:02:10,897 --> 01:02:11,856
Happy birthday!

1111
01:02:11,898 --> 01:02:12,857
Merry Christmas!

1112
01:02:12,899 --> 01:02:13,858
It's not Christmas.

1113
01:02:13,900 --> 01:02:14,859
Happy Hanukkah!

1114
01:02:14,901 --> 01:02:15,860
We're leaving Stitch?

1115
01:02:15,902 --> 01:02:16,861
Trust me.

1116
01:02:16,903 --> 01:02:18,238
This is not going to end well.

1117
01:02:18,279 --> 01:02:19,698
-One potato.
-Two potato.

1118
01:02:19,739 --> 01:02:21,199
-Three potato.
-Four.

1119
01:02:21,241 --> 01:02:22,701
-Five potato.
-Six potato.

1120
01:02:22,784 --> 01:02:24,077
Seven potato, more.

1121
01:02:24,119 --> 01:02:26,079
My... mother... told... me...

1122
01:02:26,079 --> 01:02:27,080
you... are... it.

1123
01:02:27,080 --> 01:02:28,415
Oh, I win!

1124
01:02:36,047 --> 01:02:37,674
Thanks. Mahalo plenty.

1125
01:02:37,716 --> 01:02:38,842
You won't be disappointed.

1126
01:02:38,883 --> 01:02:41,177
I'll show up early to help
with the morning deliver...

1127
01:02:44,723 --> 01:02:46,683
Oh, don't turn left.

1128
01:02:49,436 --> 01:02:50,854
No.

1129
01:02:55,734 --> 01:02:59,237
One of them had a giant eye
in the middle of his face.

1130
01:02:59,279 --> 01:03:00,780
Oh, Lilo!

1131
01:03:02,907 --> 01:03:05,076
Please don't do this.

1132
01:03:05,118 --> 01:03:07,328
You know I have no choice.

1133
01:03:07,370 --> 01:03:09,080
No! You're not taking her!

1134
01:03:09,122 --> 01:03:11,082
I'm the only one
who understands her!

1135
01:03:11,124 --> 01:03:13,126
You take that away,
she won't stand a chance!

1136
01:03:13,126 --> 01:03:15,211
You're making this harder
than it needs to be.

1137
01:03:15,253 --> 01:03:17,422
You don't know
what you're doing! She needs me!

1138
01:03:17,464 --> 01:03:19,591
Is this what she needs?!

1139
01:03:19,632 --> 01:03:22,802
It seems clear to me
that you need her

1140
01:03:22,844 --> 01:03:25,430
a lot more than she needs you.

1141
01:03:29,392 --> 01:03:32,145
Lilo! Lilo!

1142
01:03:32,187 --> 01:03:33,480
Lilo!

1143
01:03:33,521 --> 01:03:35,315
Lilo!

1144
01:03:35,357 --> 01:03:36,941
Lilo!

1145
01:03:43,323 --> 01:03:44,866
Lilo!

1146
01:03:44,908 --> 01:03:46,951
Lilo!

1147
01:03:55,919 --> 01:03:58,046
You ruined everything.

1148
01:04:05,136 --> 01:04:07,889
You're one of them?

1149
01:04:08,932 --> 01:04:09,974
Ooh!

1150
01:04:10,016 --> 01:04:11,685
Get out of here, Stitch.

1151
01:04:14,979 --> 01:04:16,940
Surprise!

1152
01:04:18,358 --> 01:04:21,528
And here I thought
you'd be difficult to catch.

1153
01:04:21,569 --> 01:04:24,823
Ho-ho-ho. Silly me.

1154
01:04:24,864 --> 01:04:25,865
Lilo?

1155
01:04:27,200 --> 01:04:29,327
Lilo!

1156
01:04:40,630 --> 01:04:43,550
There you go,
all buckled up for the trip.

1157
01:04:45,010 --> 01:04:47,512
And look-- I even caught you
a little snack.

1158
01:04:53,935 --> 01:04:56,730
No! Stop!

1159
01:05:06,656 --> 01:05:08,533
Lilo.

1160
01:05:10,285 --> 01:05:11,578
Aah!

1161
01:05:11,619 --> 01:05:12,912
Okay, talk.

1162
01:05:12,954 --> 01:05:14,789
I know you had something
to do with this.

1163
01:05:14,831 --> 01:05:16,124
Now where is Lilo?

1164
01:05:16,166 --> 01:05:18,960
Talk! I know you can.

1165
01:05:20,503 --> 01:05:22,964
Okay, okay.

1166
01:05:25,925 --> 01:05:28,720
Where's Lilo?

1167
01:05:28,762 --> 01:05:30,555
Lilo...

1168
01:05:33,767 --> 01:05:35,393
Now all your washing is up!

1169
01:05:35,435 --> 01:05:36,728
You're under arrest!

1170
01:05:36,770 --> 01:05:38,021
Read him his rights.

1171
01:05:38,063 --> 01:05:40,065
Listen carefully.

1172
01:05:42,734 --> 01:05:44,319
Hello? Galactic Command?

1173
01:05:44,361 --> 01:05:47,030
Experiment 6-2-6 is in custody.

1174
01:05:47,072 --> 01:05:49,074
We'll wait right here.

1175
01:05:56,831 --> 01:05:58,041
Huh?

1176
01:05:58,083 --> 01:06:01,086
Don't interact with her.

1177
01:06:04,589 --> 01:06:06,132
Where's Lilo?

1178
01:06:06,174 --> 01:06:07,133
Who?

1179
01:06:07,175 --> 01:06:08,301
What?!

1180
01:06:10,512 --> 01:06:13,473
Lilo... my sister.

1181
01:06:15,433 --> 01:06:18,311
Uh, sorry, we do not know

1182
01:06:18,353 --> 01:06:20,939
anyone by this, uh...

1183
01:06:20,980 --> 01:06:22,816
Lilo! She's a little girl--
this big!

1184
01:06:22,857 --> 01:06:24,567
She has black hair
and brown eyes

1185
01:06:24,609 --> 01:06:26,528
and she hangs around
with that thing!

1186
01:06:26,569 --> 01:06:27,862
Uh...

1187
01:06:29,823 --> 01:06:31,658
We know her.

1188
01:06:31,700 --> 01:06:34,285
Bring her back.

1189
01:06:34,327 --> 01:06:36,121
Oh, we can't do that. Uh-uh.

1190
01:06:36,162 --> 01:06:38,707
That would be a misuse
of Galactic resources.

1191
01:06:38,832 --> 01:06:42,711
See, problem is...
we're just here for him.

1192
01:06:42,794 --> 01:06:45,046
So she's gone?

1193
01:06:45,088 --> 01:06:46,464
Look at the bright side.

1194
01:06:46,506 --> 01:06:48,717
You won't have to yell
at anyone anymore.

1195
01:06:58,101 --> 01:06:59,811
Come.

1196
01:07:10,030 --> 01:07:11,322
O'hana.

1197
01:07:11,364 --> 01:07:12,365
Huh?

1198
01:07:12,365 --> 01:07:13,658
Hey! Get away from her.

1199
01:07:13,742 --> 01:07:16,036
No! What did you say?

1200
01:07:16,077 --> 01:07:20,123
O'hana means family.

1201
01:07:20,165 --> 01:07:22,083
Family means...

1202
01:07:22,125 --> 01:07:24,794
...nobody gets left behind.

1203
01:07:24,836 --> 01:07:26,671
Or forgotten.

1204
01:07:26,713 --> 01:07:28,048
Yeah.

1205
01:07:30,300 --> 01:07:32,010
Hey...

1206
01:07:32,052 --> 01:07:35,221
What?!
After all you put me through

1207
01:07:35,263 --> 01:07:38,391
you expect me to help you
just like that?!

1208
01:07:38,433 --> 01:07:40,185
Just like that?!

1209
01:07:40,226 --> 01:07:41,519
Ih.

1210
01:07:41,561 --> 01:07:43,188
Fine.

1211
01:07:43,229 --> 01:07:44,981
Fine?
You're doing what he says?

1212
01:07:45,023 --> 01:07:47,275
Uh, he's very persuasive.

1213
01:07:47,317 --> 01:07:50,862
Persuasive?!
What exactly are we doing?

1214
01:07:50,904 --> 01:07:51,988
Rescue.

1215
01:07:52,030 --> 01:07:53,406
We're going to get Lilo?

1216
01:07:53,448 --> 01:07:54,616
Ih.

1217
01:07:56,910 --> 01:08:00,038
Oh, good! I was hoping
to add theft, endangerment

1218
01:08:00,080 --> 01:08:03,083
and insanity to my list
of things I did today.

1219
01:08:03,124 --> 01:08:04,334
You, too?

1220
01:08:10,215 --> 01:08:11,925
Oh! Yeah, yeah, yeah!

1221
01:08:11,966 --> 01:08:14,135
What? Did you think
we walked here?

1222
01:08:15,762 --> 01:08:18,973
This is Gantu, requesting
hyperspace clearance.

1223
01:08:19,015 --> 01:08:21,017
Stand by for clearance.

1224
01:09:05,061 --> 01:09:08,440
Clearance is granted
on vector C-12.

1225
01:09:08,481 --> 01:09:10,150
Connect me
to the Grand Councilwoman.

1226
01:09:10,191 --> 01:09:12,193
Gantu, what's going on?

1227
01:09:12,235 --> 01:09:13,570
I thought you'd like to know

1228
01:09:13,611 --> 01:09:15,447
that the little abomination
is... is...

1229
01:09:20,452 --> 01:09:22,370
Yes, Captain?

1230
01:09:24,748 --> 01:09:27,292
I'll call you back.

1231
01:09:31,504 --> 01:09:33,548
How did you get out of there?

1232
01:09:37,135 --> 01:09:39,220
So what exactly are we doing?

1233
01:09:39,262 --> 01:09:41,681
Don't worry,
is all part of plan.

1234
01:09:41,765 --> 01:09:43,308
We are professionals.

1235
01:09:43,350 --> 01:09:45,852
Hey! Get that out of your mouth!

1236
01:09:53,151 --> 01:09:55,487
Hold on!

1237
01:10:04,329 --> 01:10:07,082
Okay, is show time!

1238
01:10:21,179 --> 01:10:22,555
This is it!

1239
01:10:28,311 --> 01:10:30,146
Go! Go! Go!

1240
01:10:42,033 --> 01:10:44,703
Little savage!
Get off my ship!

1241
01:10:49,416 --> 01:10:50,917
Stitch!

1242
01:11:04,055 --> 01:11:07,726
Computer,
locate Experiment 6-2-6.

1243
01:11:07,767 --> 01:11:09,853
6-2-6 located.

1244
01:11:09,894 --> 01:11:12,230
We finish this now.

1245
01:11:14,941 --> 01:11:16,443
Stitch is unconscious.

1246
01:11:16,484 --> 01:11:17,736
What do we do now?

1247
01:11:17,777 --> 01:11:18,737
We stay close.

1248
01:11:18,778 --> 01:11:20,071
Hope for a miracle.

1249
01:11:20,113 --> 01:11:21,740
That's all we can do.

1250
01:11:32,959 --> 01:11:34,252
No!

1251
01:11:36,087 --> 01:11:37,964
Don't leave me, okay?

1252
01:11:38,006 --> 01:11:39,215
Okay.

1253
01:11:41,676 --> 01:11:43,636
Okay.

1254
01:11:47,682 --> 01:11:49,893
Okay.

1255
01:11:57,192 --> 01:11:59,069
Target 6-2-6 is in motion.

1256
01:11:59,110 --> 01:12:00,403
Speed is 84.

1257
01:12:00,445 --> 01:12:02,530
Impossible!

1258
01:12:28,014 --> 01:12:29,224
Stitch!

1259
01:12:29,265 --> 01:12:30,308
Hmm?

1260
01:12:31,685 --> 01:12:33,228
Abomination.

1261
01:12:33,269 --> 01:12:34,604
Stupidhead.

1262
01:12:39,818 --> 01:12:41,486
Yee-haw!

1263
01:12:43,947 --> 01:12:44,864
Aloha!

1264
01:12:46,366 --> 01:12:48,743
You're vile! You're foul!
You're flawed!

1265
01:12:48,827 --> 01:12:51,454
Also cute and fluffy!

1266
01:13:04,175 --> 01:13:05,844
You came back.

1267
01:13:05,885 --> 01:13:08,179
Nobody gets left behind.

1268
01:13:16,771 --> 01:13:17,856
Lilo!

1269
01:13:23,903 --> 01:13:25,697
Good dog.

1270
01:13:41,129 --> 01:13:42,881
Auwe!

1271
01:13:42,922 --> 01:13:45,008
David!

1272
01:13:45,050 --> 01:13:46,134
Hey, Lilo.

1273
01:13:46,176 --> 01:13:48,386
Can you give us a ride
to shore?

1274
01:13:48,428 --> 01:13:49,554
Uh...

1275
01:13:50,972 --> 01:13:52,390
Sure!

1276
01:13:52,432 --> 01:13:55,226
But I have to make two trips.

1277
01:13:55,852 --> 01:13:58,021
So you're from outer space, huh?

1278
01:13:58,063 --> 01:13:59,564
I heard the surfing's choice.

1279
01:13:59,606 --> 01:14:01,900
We have 6-2-6.

1280
01:14:01,941 --> 01:14:03,735
Take him to my ship.

1281
01:14:03,777 --> 01:14:05,070
Leave him alone.

1282
01:14:05,111 --> 01:14:06,071
Hold on.

1283
01:14:06,112 --> 01:14:08,073
Grand Councilwoman,
let me explain.

1284
01:14:08,114 --> 01:14:09,407
Silence!

1285
01:14:09,449 --> 01:14:13,536
I am retiring you,
Captain Gantu.

1286
01:14:13,578 --> 01:14:16,456
Actually, credit for the capture
goes to...

1287
01:14:16,456 --> 01:14:17,707
Goes to me.

1288
01:14:17,791 --> 01:14:20,418
You'll be lucky if you end up
on a Fluff Trog farm

1289
01:14:20,460 --> 01:14:22,337
after we sort this thing out.

1290
01:14:22,379 --> 01:14:23,672
Uh...

1291
01:14:23,713 --> 01:14:24,923
I think I should...

1292
01:14:24,964 --> 01:14:25,924
You!

1293
01:14:25,965 --> 01:14:27,175
You're the cause of all this!

1294
01:14:27,217 --> 01:14:28,885
If it wasn't
for your Experiment 6-2-6

1295
01:14:28,927 --> 01:14:29,886
none of this...

1296
01:14:29,928 --> 01:14:31,888
Stitch.

1297
01:14:31,930 --> 01:14:33,264
What?

1298
01:14:33,306 --> 01:14:35,100
My name Stitch.

1299
01:14:35,141 --> 01:14:36,434
Stitch, then.

1300
01:14:36,476 --> 01:14:39,604
If it wasn't for Stitch....

1301
01:14:40,939 --> 01:14:43,274
Does Stitch have to go
in the ship?

1302
01:14:43,316 --> 01:14:46,111
Yes.

1303
01:14:46,152 --> 01:14:48,113
Can Stitch say good-bye?

1304
01:14:49,406 --> 01:14:50,824
Yes.

1305
01:14:50,865 --> 01:14:52,867
Thank you.

1306
01:14:56,996 --> 01:14:59,791
Who are you?

1307
01:15:01,376 --> 01:15:03,878
This is my family.

1308
01:15:03,920 --> 01:15:07,674
I found it all on my own.

1309
01:15:07,799 --> 01:15:11,261
It's little and broken...

1310
01:15:11,344 --> 01:15:13,263
but still good.

1311
01:15:13,304 --> 01:15:15,974
Yeah. Still good.

1312
01:15:25,775 --> 01:15:27,277
Does he really have to go?

1313
01:15:28,653 --> 01:15:32,532
You know as well as I
that our laws are absolute.

1314
01:15:32,532 --> 01:15:36,119
I cannot change
what the Council has decided.

1315
01:15:36,161 --> 01:15:40,331
Lilo, didn't you buy
that thing at the shelter?

1316
01:15:44,169 --> 01:15:45,378
Hey!

1317
01:15:47,047 --> 01:15:50,342
Three days ago,
I bought Stitch at the shelter.

1318
01:15:50,383 --> 01:15:52,302
I paid two dollars for him.

1319
01:15:52,344 --> 01:15:54,220
See this stamp? I own him.

1320
01:15:54,262 --> 01:15:58,016
If you take him,
you're stealing.

1321
01:15:59,601 --> 01:16:02,729
Aliens are all about rules.

1322
01:16:02,812 --> 01:16:05,231
You look familiar.

1323
01:16:05,273 --> 01:16:09,569
CIA. Roswell. 1973.

1324
01:16:09,611 --> 01:16:12,489
Ah, yes. You had hair then.

1325
01:16:12,530 --> 01:16:14,949
Take note of this.

1326
01:16:14,991 --> 01:16:19,537
This creature has been sentenced
to life in exile

1327
01:16:19,579 --> 01:16:24,668
a sentence that shall be
henceforth served out here...

1328
01:16:24,709 --> 01:16:29,297
on Earth...

1329
01:16:29,339 --> 01:16:33,259
and as caretaker
of the alien life-form, Stitch

1330
01:16:33,301 --> 01:16:37,472
this family is now
under the official protection

1331
01:16:37,514 --> 01:16:40,433
of the United Galactic
Federation.

1332
01:16:40,433 --> 01:16:43,436
We'll be checking in
now and then.

1333
01:16:43,478 --> 01:16:46,189
I was afraid
you were going to say that.

1334
01:16:46,231 --> 01:16:49,818
This won't be easy to explain
back at headquarters.

1335
01:16:49,859 --> 01:16:53,363
I know what you mean.

1336
01:16:56,533 --> 01:16:59,369
Don't let those two
get on my ship.

1337
01:17:09,004 --> 01:17:10,547
CIA?

1338
01:17:10,630 --> 01:17:11,589
Former.

1339
01:17:11,631 --> 01:17:13,675
Saved the planet once.

1340
01:17:13,717 --> 01:17:15,927
Convinced an alien race
that mosquitoes

1341
01:17:15,969 --> 01:17:17,595
were an endangered species.

1342
01:17:17,637 --> 01:17:20,098
Now, about your house...

1343
01:17:22,976 --> 01:17:24,811
Wait.

1344
01:17:33,987 --> 01:17:38,616
# Lord Almighty,
